//
//   File path within the project.
//   Where this file lives in the repository structure.
//
//   Path: [relative/path/to/file]
//
// Path: a-void/planning/workflow/alignment-workflow.jsonc
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.5 Derivation [DERIVATION]
//
//   Template lineage and inheritance.
//   Traces where this file came from in the template chain.
//
//   Derives_from: [path/to/parent/template] — file lineage (pragma meta.from = spec)
//
// Derives_from: bereshit/word/seed/data/json/3block/config.jsonc
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.6 Classification [CLASSIFICATION]
//
//   Keywords for discovery and categorization.
//   How to find this file when searching the codebase.
//
//   Tags: [keyword, keyword, ...] — discovery and categorization
//
// Tags: workflow, alignment, gap-analysis, chunk-by-chunk, rails, void
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.7 Intent [INTENT]
//
//   Why this file exists and what it enables.
//   The purpose, design philosophy, and key capabilities.
//
//   Purpose:     [Enables X for Y]
//   Core Design: [Architectural pattern]
//   Philosophy:  [Guiding principle]
//   Key Features:
//     - [Major capability]
//
// Purpose: Document alignment patterns — ensure documentation matches reality
// Core Design: Workflow documentation — patterns discovered through practice
// Philosophy: Contract - Reality = The Work — gap analysis reveals alignment tasks
//
// Key Features:
//   Gap analysis:    Read docs → Check reality → Identify gaps → Fix
//   Chunk-by-chunk:  Work through structure level by level, not all at once
//   Cross-updating:  Files align TO templates AND templates refine BY usage
//   Bidirectional:   Reality informs docs, docs inform future reality
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.8 Grounding [GROUNDING]
//
//   Biblical foundation for this file's purpose.
//   Dig deeper — find the verse that best fits THIS file's specific content.
//   Avoid common/generic verses; engage with Scripture purposefully.
//
//   Scripture: [Book Chapter:Verse] ([KJV|WEB])
//     "[text]"
//   Principle: [Kingdom principle — bridge between Scripture and purpose]
//   Anchor: [Book Chapter:Verse] ([KJV|WEB])
//     "[text]"
//
// Scripture: Proverbs 14:23 (KJV)
//   "In all labour there is profit: but the talk of the lips tendeth only to penury."
//
// Principle: Templates carry structural DNA — labor in creating them yields profit.
//   Never write from scratch when a template exists. The work of templating
//   enables consistent, quality output across all files.
//
// Anchor: 2 Timothy 2:15 (KJV)
//   "Study to shew thyself approved unto God, a workman that needeth not to be
//    ashamed, rightly dividing the word of truth."
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.9 Dependencies [DEPENDENCIES]
//
//   What this file needs and what uses it.
//   System requirements, integrations, and consumers.
//
//   What This Needs:
//     System:   [tools, parsers]
//     External: [None | dependencies]
//     Internal: [project files]
//
//   What Uses This:
//     Commands:  [functions that consume this]
//     Processes: [workflows]
//
//   Integration:
//     - [How consumers interact with this file]
//
//   [Custom]: (file-specific extensions — must align with M.8 Grounding)
//
// What This Needs:
//   System:   Human reading, JSONC parser for validation
//   External: None
//   Internal: word/seed/ templates, glossary (gap-analysis, block-by-block)
//
// What Uses This:
//   Commands:  Alignment tasks, documentation maintenance
//   Processes: Gap analysis, documentation-reality sync
//
// Integration:
//   - Human reads workflow → identifies chunk to align → follows steps
//   - Used for maintaining documentation accuracy across repository
//
// Becomes: word/standards/workflows/alignment.jsonc when proven
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.10 Roadmap [ROADMAP]
//
//   Past, present, and future of this file.
//   History of changes, current state, and planned additions.
//
//   History: [Past changes — version notes]
//   Current: [What this file provides now]
//   Planned: [Future additions]
//
// History:
//   a-01.00 (2025-12-25): Initial capture of alignment patterns
//   a-01.01 (2025-12-25): Updated to 3-block structure with numbered sections
//   a-01.02 (2026-02-01): Aligned to 3block/config.jsonc template (M.1-M.10, Cc/Co/Cv, X.1-X.7)
//
