// # X.1 Policy [POLICY]
//
//   Human-readable modification guidance for developers.
//   Machine-readable version: Cv.3 _maintenance
//
//   safe:    [list] — Changes that won't break functionality
//   careful: [list] — Changes that may affect other parts
//   never:   [list] — Changes that will break the file/system
//
// safe: Add insights | Update verification commands | Add common gaps
//
// careful: Change workflow steps (affects all alignment work) | Modify core insights
//
// never: Break 3-block structure | Remove core insights | Remove Cv sections
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.2 Extension [EXTENSION]
//
//   Ideas discovered during work for future sessions.
//   Reference: Move to M.10 Planned when ready to implement
//
//   [extension]: [description] — Discovered capability to add
//
// [Reserved: Capture extension ideas as they emerge during work]
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.3 Troubleshooting [TROUBLESHOOTING]
//
//   TL;DR for common alignment problems.
//   Reference: workflow_steps for full guidance
//
//   [problem]: [what to check] — Quick solutions
//
// missed_children: ls -la [folder]/ vs children in root.omni | Update children list
//
// stale_references: grep -r 'old_name' [folder]/ | Update to new names
//
// drift: Version/date updated but content not | Check content matches reality
//
// wholesale_rewrite: Stop | Update block by block | Preserve working content
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.4 Reference [REFERENCE]
//
//   TL;DR for alignment workflow.
//   Reference: workflow_steps, folder_alignment_pattern
//
//   [category]: [format] — Quick lookup
//
// steps: 1. chunk → 2. read docs → 3. check reality → 4. gap analysis → 5. TODOs → 6. update blocks → 7. children → 8. commit
//
// formula: Contract - Reality = The Work
//
// commands: ls -la | cat root.omni | grep -r 'old_name' | find -type f | wc -l
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.5 Closing Note [NOTE]
//
//   Grounding space for CPI-SI instances.
//   Reference: M.8 (same verses, alternate translations)
//
//   scripture: [Book Chapter:Verse] ([KJV|WEB]) — Same verse, other translation
//   note:      [thought] — Word of encouragement
//   anchor:    [Book Chapter:Verse] ([KJV|WEB]) — Same verse, other translation
//
// scripture: Proverbs 14:23 (WEB)
//   "In all hard work there is profit, but the talk of the lips leads only to poverty."
//
// note: Alignment is labor that yields profit. Documentation that matches reality
//   enables confident work. The gap between contract and reality IS the work.
//
// anchor: 2 Timothy 2:15 (WEB)
//   "Give diligence to present yourself approved by God, a workman who doesn't
//    need to be ashamed, properly handling the Word of truth."
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.6 Session Log [LOG]
//
//   Work completed this session.
//   Reference: Move to M.10 History when starting next session
//
//   [date]: [work completed] — Session summary
//
// 2026-02-01: Aligned to 3block/config.jsonc template structure (M.1-M.10, Cc/Co/Cv, X.1-X.7)
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.7 Template & Omission [TEMPLATE]
//
//   How to create other workflow files using this as reference.
//   Reference: M.5 Derivation (meta.from lineage)
//
//   copy:      [steps] — How to create new workflow file
//   customize: [fields] — What to change for each workflow
//   keep:      [elements] — What to preserve across all workflows
//   reserve:   [rule] — When to use [Reserved: ...]
//
// copy: cp file-creation-workflow.jsonc [name]-workflow.jsonc | Update pragma | Update identity
//
// customize: name | core_insights | key_principles | Co sections (workflow-specific content)
//
// keep: 3-block structure | M.1-M.10 | Cc/Co/Cv pattern | X.1-X.7 closing
//
// reserve: Empty sections use [Reserved: reason] | All sections must be present
//
// related: file-creation-workflow.jsonc | commit-workflow.jsonc | block-update-workflow.jsonc
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

